  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-6673 Financing Agrochemical Reduction and Management (FARM) in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The GEF financed project (Grant: USD 4,000,000; Co-financing: USD 20,400,000), implemented by the Department of Agriculture (DOA) with support of the United Nations Development The project will be implemented in Oudomxay, Luang Namtha, Xiengkhuang, Bolikhamxay Province and Vientiane Capital from December 2023 until December 2027 with a total budget of 4,200,000 USD. It is aligned with the 9th National Socio-Economic Development Plan, Outcome 4, Output 1: Natural resources sustainably used and managed.</narrative>
  </description>
